{"id":865,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>9月10日上午，我院为胡满红老师举行荣休仪式。院领导、专业负责人、教师代表齐聚一堂，共同回顾胡满红老师深耕教育、潜心育人的难忘岁月，并向胡满红老师致以崇高敬意和美好祝福。院领导通过献花、送礼物、座谈等方式，对胡满红老师表达了关怀与祝福。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL7CSDLlrkUl7bLzzlPMR9DU46RolClYnNnRM8rknl7ZM7L0gihFp2hmCIa0okhfU1h7LYy4UNMfUlnknR9DM8U4UzU4o7CbMR7aUmnRnzMFLm9DozUanNWFM478L4NJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8ABD33BCAADBD867D3A438F9410B4CE3/286940FB/71439\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL7CSDLlrkUl7bLzzlPMR9DU46RolClYnNnRM8rknl7ZM7L0gihFp2hmCIa0okhfU1h7LYy4UNMfUlnknR9DM8U4UzU4o7CbMR7aUmnRnzMFLm9DozUanNWFM478L4NJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg\"></p><p>仪式上，关世玺和赵熹介绍了胡满红老师的工作经历，分享了飞行器制造工程专业的成长史，讲述了胡满红老师在专业建设、人才培养和团队发展等方面作出的贡献：她始终坚守教育一线，数十年如一日，爱岗敬业、默默奉献，把青春与智慧倾注于教育事业；她以严谨的治学态度、温暖的育人情怀，影响和培养了一批又一批学生，深受学生爱戴和同事敬重。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=noRQSVUl7ZUmC4MzzV7LRr2LmN4oz9laL4-iLllaoz-ZM7-0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaMSybUSybn7lDLRlsLRVRnRC4MRlbMlW2nmUYnNlsnmVFLm98L4lsMlVFMzCDnllJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0059A9DE605701CD634595BFF42FE7F1/2843575A/566EE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=noRQSVUl7ZUmC4MzzV7LRr2LmN4oz9laL4-iLllaoz-ZM7-0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaMSybUSybn7lDLRlsLRVRnRC4MRlbMlW2nmUYnNlsnmVFLm98L4lsMlVFMzCDnllJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg\"></p><p>罗建国书记表示，胡满红老师是学院发展的见证者、参与者和贡献者，胡满红老师的敬业精神、责任担当和优良作风，是学院宝贵的精神财富。希望青年教师以胡满红老师为榜样，接好立德树人的“接力棒”，赓续教育初心，传承育人使命。张丽花回顾了与胡满红老师共事的点滴，表达了对胡满红老师的不舍与敬意，并祝愿胡满红老师退休后生活幸福、喜乐安康。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nMlCSDUmf2LRv8Uzz7aMNL8UNM7LNllYoznfnm7sozvYLRG0gihFp2hmCIa0M1h2okhVLSh2LmVRn7W2MmvZL4ffMmWfUlnkM4WRLN-YnmfFnzlaMlWVnRQFMR9YLm7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6F8E1F21CDBF67830A62AADB72C2B2F0/E505BED6/48221\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nLl-SZUm98LlCZMz7MRLRr7MmV2U8rlRozA2ollDM7LYMzC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhknSyDnkyPL4Q7UmLsUN-bnRGDM4NaUzVRMmnfnm-Pn7VFMzL8U4V2LNnFUNLDLz9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg\"></p><p>胡满红老师也深情回顾了自己的从教生涯，感谢学院的培养、同事的支持和学生的陪伴，并表示退休后将继续关心学院发展，祝愿学院事业蒸蒸日上。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL4NSbUml4nlnkLz4QRL4NZU8MfL4GlDoR6Rn77YnN7YMl70gihFp2hmCIa0M1yYUYhVU1hfLl7iM4A7nzTfUzGaMl7aU8QRM8WkMzliL4VFn7VfoRUZnNrFL4VRnN-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/62CEBA1A578DE9AA005A0CFC7BB55531/DAA848FE/31CFB\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL4NSbUml4nlnkLz4QRL4NZU8MfL4GlDoR6Rn77YnN7YMl70gihFp2hmCIa0M1yYUYhVU1hfLl7iM4A7nzTfUzGaMl7aU8QRM8WkMzliL4VFn7VfoRUZnNrFL4VRnN-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg\"></p><p>在座谈交流环节，大家还围绕退休后的生活安排畅所欲言，以提高退休后高质量生活为目标，希望胡满红老师退休后生活丰富多彩、从容自在。院领导为胡满红老师颁发荣休纪念品并献上鲜花，大家共同送上祝福：“恭贺胡满红老师荣休，愿此后岁月从容，喜乐长安！”仪式在温馨的合影中圆满结束。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nLR-SZMNrRM4rRUz4ffnlCbLNLso7llZMRCDnzT7o7C8olU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVMYyDLYyZU8r7nmQRo7-io7-bo7WkL8-ZMNUDnNQRMmVFUzCsLRCPL4AFLmTkn7CJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0E7638CEDF6C8B58B98BB3B86D6FFC61/A6706138/29BDF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nM87SPU4UYU8-sUz8MRLNCiol7YLmUl4olUPM4-DnRvbM8C0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yDn1y8UYy8M4-Yo7VVnmARM4TfnR9bLN7PMRUbMRVRM4rFLmLsL4fVn7nFU87bnm-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg\"></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL7CSDLlrkUl7bLzzlPMR9DU46RolClYnNnRM8rknl7ZM7L0gihFp2hmCIa0okhfU1h7LYy4UNMfUlnknR9DM8U4UzU4o7CbMR7aUmnRnzMFLm9DozUanNWFM478L4NJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLzvsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12177&e=.jpg"}